---
description: React frontend rules
globs: *.tsx
---

- Use React + TypeScript + Ant Design
- Use pnpm as package manager

- No inline styles
- Use CSS Modules for styling (Component.module.css)
- Do not use JS/TS objects for styling

- Use strict TypeScript
- Avoid eslint-disable comments

- Use PascalCase for component names
- Use camelCase for variables and functions

- Each component should be in its own folder named after the component

- Split into files ONLY when needed:
  - index.tsx (component logic)
  - Component.module.css (if styling is non-trivial)
  - constants file (if there are real constants)
  - utils file (if reusable logic exists)
